# Wireframes — Implement Register User API Integration

## Notation Legend

| Symbol | Meaning | Symbol | Meaning |
|--------|---------|--------|---------|
| `[...]` | Button / interactive element | `[>...▼]` | Dropdown |
| `_______` | Text input / editable field | `[X]` | Close / dismiss |
| `⚠` | Warning / due date | `📎N` | N attachments |
| `💬N` | N comments | `🔗` | Card relationship |
| `👤` | User / mention | `○ ●` | Radio unselected / selected |

## Accessibility — Shared Conventions

| Concern | Convention |
|---------|------------|
| Landmarks | `header`, `main`, `aside`, `contentinfo` |
| Heading order | One `h1` per screen, `h2` for sections |
| Accessible names | Icon-only controls get `aria-label` |
| Keyboard | Tab, Enter/Space, Escape, Arrow keys |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px reservation |
| Non-color intent | Icon + text, never color alone |

---

## Screen Inventory

| Flow | Screen | States | Wireframe Section |
|------|--------|--------|-------------------|
| Registration | LoginPage | idle, loading, error | [LoginPage](#loginpage) |
| Registration | RegisterPage | idle, loading, error, success | [RegisterPage](#registerpage) |

---

## LoginPage

### Purpose & Flow Context

Entry point for unauthenticated users. Allows login with email/password or navigate to registration. Serves as the starting point of the Registration flow. Exit to Dashboard on success, RegisterPage on "Sign up".

### Layout Regions

**Grid**: 12-column layout. Spacing cadence: 8px rhythm.

**App-shell**: Minimal for auth pages — centered content, no nav shell.

| Region | Content | Notes |
|--------|---------|-------|
| Main | Auth card centered | Vertically + horizontally centered |
| Card Header | Logo/brand, title | "Sign in to your account" |
| Card Content | Form fields, CTA | Email, password, submit button |
| Card Footer | Link to register | "Don't have an account? Sign up" |

**Content hierarchy** (by visual priority):
1. Form fields (email, password)
2. Primary CTA (Sign in)
3. Secondary link (Sign up)

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|                       [Logo / Brand]                              |
|                                                                    |
|            +----------------------------------+                   |
|            |  Sign in to your account         |                   |
|            +----------------------------------|                   |
|            |                                  |                   |
|            |  [______ Email address _______]  |                   |
|            |  [______ Password ______________]|                   |
|            |                                  |                   |
|            |  [ Button: Sign in ]             |                   |
|            |                                  |                   |
|            |  Don't have an account? [Sign up]|                   |
|            +----------------------------------+                   |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Email input | Input[type=email] | Focus ring, validation on blur | Invalid format: error message |
| Password input | Input[type=password] | Masked, optional show/hide | Min length validation |
| Sign in button | Button[primary] | Submit form, loading state | Disabled when loading |
| Sign up link | Anchor/Link | Navigate to RegisterPage | — |

### Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| Heading | "Sign in to your account" | Clear, welcoming |
| Email label | "Email address" | User language, not "email" |
| Password label | "Password" | — |
| Button | "Sign in" | Action-oriented |
| Footer link | "Don't have an account? Sign up" | Guidance to register |

### States

#### Populated (Default)

Form fields empty, ready for input. All elements visible and interactive.

#### Loading

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|            +----------------------------------+                   |
|            |  Sign in to your account         |                   |
|            +----------------------------------|                   |
|            |  [______ Email address _______]  |                   |
|            |  [______ Password ______________]|                   |
|            |                                  |                   |
|            |  [ Button: (Spinner) Signing in ]|                   |
|            |                                  |                   |
|            |  Don't have an account? [Sign up]|                   |
|            +----------------------------------+                   |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

Button shows spinner, text changes to "Signing in". All inputs disabled. No double-submit.

#### Error

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|            +----------------------------------+                   |
|            |  Sign in to your account         |                   |
|            +----------------------------------|                   |
|            |  ⚠ Invalid email or password     |                   |
|            +----------------------------------|                   |
|            |  [______ Email address _______]  |                   |
|            |  [______ Password ______________]|                   |
|            |                                  |                   |
|            |  [ Button: Sign in ]             |                   |
|            |                                  |                   |
|            |  Don't have an account? [Sign up]|                   |
|            +----------------------------------+                   |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

Alert component above form with error message. Inline validation per field if applicable.

### Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | Centered card, max-width 400px |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | Same centered layout |
| Mobile (<768px) | Full-width card, padding 16px |

### Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | main (card region) |
| Heading order | h1 "Sign in to your account" |
| Reading / Focus order | Email → Password → Submit → Footer link |
| Accessible names | All inputs have visible labels |
| Keyboard operability | Tab through fields, Enter submits |
| Target size | All interactive elements ≥24×24 CSS px |
| Focus not obscured | No sticky elements on auth pages |
| Non-color intent | Error icon + text message, not color alone |

---

## RegisterPage

### Purpose & Flow Context

Allows new users to create an account. Entry from LoginPage "Sign up" link. Exit to Dashboard on success, LoginPage on "Sign in" link.

### Layout Regions

**Grid**: 12-column layout. Spacing cadence: 8px rhythm.

**App-shell**: Minimal for auth pages — centered content, no nav shell.

| Region | Content | Notes |
|--------|---------|-------|
| Main | Auth card centered | Vertically + horizontally centered |
| Card Header | Logo/brand, title | "Create your account" |
| Card Content | Form fields, CTA | Name, email, password, confirm password |
| Card Footer | Link to login | "Already have an account? Sign in" |

**Content hierarchy** (by visual priority):
1. Form fields (name, email, password, confirm password)
2. Primary CTA (Create account)
3. Secondary link (Sign in)

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|                       [Logo / Brand]                              |
|                                                                    |
|            +----------------------------------+                   |
|            |  Create your account             |                   |
|            +----------------------------------|                   |
|            |                                  |                   |
|            |  [______ Full name ____________] |                   |
|            |  [______ Email address _______]  |                   |
|            |  [______ Password ______________]|                   |
|            |  [______ Confirm password ______]|                   |
|            |                                  |                   |
|            |  [ Button: Create account ]      |                   |
|            |                                  |                   |
|            |  Already have an account? [Sign  |                   |
|            |  in]                             |                   |
|            +----------------------------------+                   |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Name input | Input[type=text] | Focus ring, required | Empty: error on submit |
| Email input | Input[type=email] | Focus ring, format validation | Invalid: error on submit |
| Password input | Input[type=password] | Masked, min 8 chars | Too short: error on submit |
| Confirm password | Input[type=password] | Masked, must match password | Mismatch: error on submit |
| Create account button | Button[primary] | Submit form, loading state | Disabled when loading |
| Sign in link | Anchor/Link | Navigate to LoginPage | — |

### Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| Heading | "Create your account" | Clear, action-oriented |
| Name label | "Full name" | User language |
| Email label | "Email address" | — |
| Password label | "Password" | — |
| Confirm label | "Confirm password" | — |
| Button | "Create account" | Action-oriented |
| Footer link | "Already have an account? Sign in" | Guidance to login |

### States

#### Populated (Default / Idle)

Form fields empty, ready for input. All elements visible and interactive.

#### Loading

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|            +----------------------------------+                   |
|            |  Create your account             |                   |
|            +----------------------------------|                   |
|            |  [______ Full name ____________] |                   |
|            |  [______ Email address _______]  |                   |
|            |  [______ Password ______________]|                   |
|            |  [______ Confirm password ______]|                   |
|            |                                  |                   |
|            |  [ Button: (Spinner) Creating     |
|            |   account... ]                    |                   |
|            |                                  |                   |
|            |  Already have an account? [Sign  |                   |
|            |  in]                             |                   |
|            +----------------------------------+                   |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

Button shows spinner, text changes to "Creating...". All inputs disabled. No double-submit.

#### Error (Client-side Validation)

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|            +----------------------------------+                   |
|            |  Create your account             |                   |
|            +----------------------------------|                   |
|            |  [______ Full name ____________] |                   |
|            |  ⚠ Name is required              |                   |
|            |  [______ Email address _______]  |                   |
|            |  ⚠ Please enter a valid email    |                   |
|            |  [______ Password ______________]|                   |
|            |  ⚠ Password must be 8+ characters|                   |
|            |  [______ Confirm password ______]|                   |
|            |  ⚠ Passwords do not match        |                   |
|            |                                  |                   |
|            |  [ Button: Create account ]      |                   |
|            |                                  |                   |
|            |  Already have an account? [Sign  |                   |
|            |  in]                             |                   |
|            +----------------------------------+                   |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

Per-field error messages below each input. Alert component at top for server errors (409 conflict: "Email already in use").

#### Error (Server-side)

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|            +----------------------------------+                   |
|            |  Create your account             |                   |
|            +----------------------------------|                   |
|            |  ⚠ This email is already in use  |                   |
|            +----------------------------------|                   |
|            |  [______ Full name ____________] |                   |
|            |  [______ Email address _______]  |                   |
|            |  [______ Password ______________]|                   |
|            |  [______ Confirm password ______]|                   |
|            |                                  |                   |
|            |  [ Button: Create account ]      |                   |
|            |                                  |                   |
|            |  Already have an account? [Sign  |                   |
|            |  in]                             |                   |
|            +----------------------------------+                   |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

Alert component at top with server error. Fields remain editable.

#### Success

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|            +----------------------------------+                   |
|            |  Create your account             |                   |
|            +----------------------------------|                   |
|            |                                  |                   |
|            |  ✓ Account created successfully  |                   |
|            |                                  |                   |
|            |  Redirecting to dashboard...     |                   |
|            |                                  |                   |
|            +----------------------------------+                   |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

Success alert, brief message, auto-redirect to Dashboard after 2 seconds.

### Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | Centered card, max-width 400px |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | Same centered layout |
| Mobile (<768px) | Full-width card, padding 16px, fields stack vertically |

### Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | main (card region) |
| Heading order | h1 "Create your account" |
| Reading / Focus order | Name → Email → Password → Confirm → Submit → Footer link |
| Accessible names | All inputs have visible labels |
| Keyboard operability | Tab through fields, Enter submits |
| Target size | All interactive elements ≥24×24 CSS px |
| Focus not obscured | No sticky elements on auth pages |
| Non-color intent | Error icon + text message, not color alone |
| Error association | Each error linked to input via aria-describedby |
| Invalid state | aria-invalid="true" on fields with errors |
